# 6. Trust psychology – visitor ko bharosa kaise hoga?

Yeh website ka sabse important design principle hai.

Trust sirf logo, animation aur expensive design se nahi aata. Trust evidence se aata hai.

Main 8 trust layers rakhunga:

| Trust layer    | Website par kya dikhayenge            |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Identity       | Legal company identity and contact    |
| Capability     | Services, technical tools and team    |
| Evidence       | Real sample outputs and case studies  |
| Process        | Step-by-step execution methodology    |
| Quality        | Accuracy validation and QA methods    |
| Security       | Data protection and confidentiality   |
| Accountability | Project owner, milestones and support |
| Transparency   | Scope, limitations and deliverables   |

## Trust badges ki jagah actual evidence

Galat approach:

- 100% accuracy
- India's No. 1 drone company
- 500+ clients
- World's best technology

Aise claims bina proof ke nahi lagayenge.

Sahi approach:

- Actual software screenshots.
- Sample GeoTIFF and GIS outputs.
- 3D model previews.
- Real team credentials.
- Relevant certifications, when verified.
- Technical methodology.
- Actual project references with permission.
