# 7. User experience psychology – website samajhne mein easy honi chahiye

Hum user ko information dhoondhne par majboor nahi karenge.

Iske liye:

Rule 1: Three-click principle

Visitor ko ideally 3 clear navigation steps ke andar relevant service aur inquiry tak pahunchna chahiye.

Rule 2: Plain language first

Technical naam ke saath simple explanation:

- Orthomosaic – Multiple drone images ko jodkar banaya gaya accurate aerial map.
- Point Cloud – 3D space mein bahut saare measured points ka collection.
- DEM – Terrain ki elevation representation.
- GIS – Location-based data ko manage aur analyze karne ki technology.

Rule 3: Show, don't just tell

Har technical service ke saath:

- Before / After
- Raw Data / Processed Output
- 2D / 3D comparison
- Sample report
- Short workflow animation

Rule 4: No information overload

Har page par ek primary CTA. Related information expandable sections mein.

Rule 5: Mobile-first

India mein bahut se visitors mobile se aayenge. Navigation, project inquiry, maps aur sample reports mobile par bhi easily accessible hone chahiye.

